    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Beings can alter their appearance at will (see the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> skill). While Shapeshifted, a being gains a +10 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> checks made to disguise appearance. Additionally, a being can disguise its appearance as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a> at no penalty.</p><p>Beings cannot alter their size without the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Metamorph\" title=\"Metamorph\">Metamorph</a> feat.</p>",
